    "reviews": "\u201cA simple 2d platformer, collect all the candies before reaching out to Luna, avoid or kill enemies. (tips: jump under platform to change their direction)\u201d<br>Play, Enjoy, Write Review(Steam Curator)<br><br>\u201cA simple minimalist platformer in which you run as a pink bun in levels to find your girlfriend. The gameplay is classic for the genre, the game itself is very bright and not complicated.\u201d<br>Gaming Grandma(Steam Curator)<br>",
